    "id": "437644",
    "original": "気が付くと、手先や肱のあたりに毛を生じているらしい。少し明るくなってから、谷川に臨んで姿を映して見ると、既に虎となっていた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "437650",
        "text": "When I regained my senses, it seemed that fur had grown on my fingers and knees. When it became slightly brighter, I looked at my reflection in a mountain stream, and I realized that I had become a tiger."
